    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "s20", "x": 170, "y": 2420, "width": 760, "height": 90, "strokeColor": "#0078D4", "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3100, "index": "cR", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "s20t", "x": 188, "y": 2432, "width": 730, "height": 66, "text": "Switch translator to the hosted-agent Responses API endpoint: on the Container App,\nset HOSTED_AGENT_NAME=<your-agent-name>  (or AGENT_RESPONSES_URL for explicit URL).\nThe translator calls /agents/<name>/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses instead of activity.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3101, "index": "cS", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Switch translator to the hosted-agent Responses API endpoint: on the Container App,\nset HOSTED_AGENT_NAME=<your-agent-name>  (or AGENT_RESPONSES_URL for explicit URL).\nThe translator calls /agents/<name>/endpoint/protocols/openai/responses instead of activity.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.57 },

    { "type": "ellipse", "id": "c21", "x": 90, "y": 2530, "width": 50, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#0078D4", "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3102, "index": "cT", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [{"type":"text","id":"c21t"}], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "c21t", "x": 100, "y": 2545, "width": 30, "height": 20, "text": "21", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3103, "index": "cU", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "c21", "originalText": "21", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.1 },
    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "s21", "x": 170, "y": 2530, "width": 760, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#0078D4", "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3104, "index": "cV", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "s21t", "x": 188, "y": 2542, "width": 730, "height": 88, "text": "Enable Code Interpreter file generation: set CONTAINER_MODE=auto in the translator /\nhosted_agent_app config. ContainerManager (containers.py) will:\n  \u2022 Create / reuse a project-scoped container (/openai/v1/containers) per conversation.\n  \u2022 List + download new assistant files; verify .pptx bytes before claiming success.", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3105, "index": "cW", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Enable Code Interpreter file generation: set CONTAINER_MODE=auto in the translator /\nhosted_agent_app config. ContainerManager (containers.py) will:\n  \u2022 Create / reuse a project-scoped container (/openai/v1/containers) per conversation.\n  \u2022 List + download new assistant files; verify .pptx bytes before claiming success.", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.57 },

    { "type": "ellipse", "id": "c22", "x": 90, "y": 2660, "width": 50, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#0078D4", "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3106, "index": "cX", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [{"type":"text","id":"c22t"}], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "c22t", "x": 100, "y": 2675, "width": 30, "height": 20, "text": "22", "fontSize": 18, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "middle", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3107, "index": "cY", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": "c22", "originalText": "22", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.1 },
    { "type": "rectangle", "id": "s22", "x": 170, "y": 2660, "width": 760, "height": 110, "strokeColor": "#0078D4", "backgroundColor": "#CFE4FA", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3108, "index": "cZ", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
    { "type": "text", "id": "s22t", "x": 188, "y": 2672, "width": 730, "height": 88, "text": "(Optional) Deploy hosted_agent_app (3-custom-translator/hosted_agent_app/) as a\nstandalone chat & verify UI. Set .env: FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT, HOSTED_AGENT_NAME,\nMCP_SERVER_LABEL, CONTAINER_MODE, AUTH_MODE. Gives per-turn diagnostics: MCP call\ncount, CI activity, consent link, structured JSON log. Includes PPT skill (ppt_skill.py).", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 2, "strokeColor": "#000000", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3109, "index": "d0", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false, "containerId": null, "originalText": "(Optional) Deploy hosted_agent_app (3-custom-translator/hosted_agent_app/) as a\nstandalone chat & verify UI. Set .env: FOUNDRY_PROJECT_ENDPOINT, HOSTED_AGENT_NAME,\nMCP_SERVER_LABEL, CONTAINER_MODE, AUTH_MODE. Gives per-turn diagnostics: MCP call\ncount, CI activity, consent link, structured JSON log. Includes PPT skill (ppt_skill.py).", "autoResize": true, "lineHeight": 1.57 },

    { "type": "ellipse", "id": "c23", "x": 90, "y": 2790, "width": 50, "height": 50, "strokeColor": "#107C10", "backgroundColor": "#DFF6DD", "fillStyle": "solid", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "opacity": 100, "angle": 0, "version": 2, "versionNonce": 3110, "index": "d1", "isDeleted": false, "seed": 1, "groupIds": [], "frameId": null, "roundness": null, "boundElements": [{"type":"text","id":"c23t"}], "updated": 1781209358896, "link": null, "locked": false },
